Follow the repository-wide coding-agent instructions in AGENTS.md.

Shared slash directives:
- /dev: development-stage mode; implement requested changes directly without backward compatibility or legacy support unless explicitly requested.
- /no-test: do not write or run tests for the active task or session.
- /docu: update project documentation for code changes made in the active task or session.

Also recognize wrapped forms such as -/dev-, -/no-test-, and -/docu- as aliases.
